# What a server's AI aircraft is asked to plan, when its server gives it a
# model to plan with (glideslope_server --ai-planner). The model is told the
# aircraft, the airport's runways as OurAirports gives them, and the task, and
# answers with a flight plan the autopilot flies - nothing else.
aircraft c172p
airport YSSY
task take off, climb to 3,000 ft and orbit the CBD
